 <p>Every source follows the team's pipeline standard (Dinis, 18 November 2026): the raw data is read through the source's own interface, timestamped and kept, never overwritten; it is turned into our JSON with its source, licence and time read; then drawn; then analysed. Each source has a home page (<a href="/sources/">Sources</a>) and an OpenAPI description (<a href="/api/">API</a>).</p>
 <p>The reading is done by data.b@PrompTugal.dinis on data.promptugal.news, not by this site. This site reads data.promptugal.news's published JSON, computes weekly totals and keeps them as history in this public repository.</p>
